	<section_number>55.1-2110</section_number>
	<catch_line>Obligation of good faith</catch_line>
	<text>
		Every contract or duty governed by this chapter imposes an obligation of good faith in its performance or enforcement.
	</text>
	<history>1982, c. 277, § 55-435; 2019, c. 712.</history>
